  "description": "“Hello, Geurim. How long has it been since you slept with me and dumped me?”\n\nBut then… right before I came to Korea, the man I accidentally, impulsively, almost as if possessed, ended up disgracefully sleeping with moved in right across from me!\n\nMo Tae-kyung. My brother’s longtime friend and the childhood friend who had witnessed every embarrassing moment of my past.\n\n“Didn’t you think about me?”\n\nWhen I didn’t answer, he swallowed my stubbornly sealed lips.\n\nMy lips parted, and Mo Tae-kyung’s tongue slipped in.\n\nDamn it. I cursed endlessly in my head. Damn it, damn it, damn it!\n\nI couldn’t help it. Mo Tae-kyung was unbelievably good at kissing. Really, truly, insanely good.\n\nSo that was why, that day too….\n\n[Original Webtoon](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/bitter_candy)",
